cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OMEGA (gomega) in your work, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "OMEGA: Optimised Modelling of Environmental Groundwater in Australia, mesh generation for G-ADOPT"
abstract: >-
  OMEGA (Python package gomega) builds terrain-following extruded meshes for
  groundwater simulation with G-ADOPT and Firedrake: a region boundary as a
  polygon, a 2D triangular mesh from gmsh, a vertical extrusion that follows
  the topography and the basement, and the interpolation of scattered field
  data onto the result.
type: software
